Error [jet.BindingTypeMismatch]: The payload of `DataEvent.Number` holds String (text), but this value is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/data_event_payload_types.jet:6:39
    |
  6 |     number: encoding.DataEvent.Number(12)
    |                                       ^^
 Why: A variant payload keeps the type its enum declaration gives it
 Fix: Put the value in text with interpolation: "{x}"
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0108

Error [jet.BindingTypeMismatch]: The payload of `DataEvent.Float` holds Float (an approximate binary number), but this value is String (text)
